<p:sld xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""/><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="ZoneTexte 3"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{D4F82E04-4C6B-467F-7A61-D328D5DB490D}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="691978" y="259492"/><a:ext cx="5492209" cy="369332"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="none" rtlCol="0"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>1. La découverte — Tout commence par un rêve ❤️</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="fr-FR" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="5" name="ZoneTexte 4"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{98A74C23-2486-513A-2292-6AFDB7694E17}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="148280" y="1173892"/><a:ext cx="11463395" cy="3693319"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="none" rtlCol="0"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Et si je vous racontais un petit bout de mon histoire… </a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Pour ceux qui me connaissent, vous le savez : je suis une passionnée, une fonceuse, </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>une amoureuse de la vie ! Les voyages, les rires, le soleil, les rêves, les rencontres… </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>J'aime partager, créer et quand je me lance, c'est à 200 % !</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>La décoration ? Je crois qu'elle a toujours fait partie de moi.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Mais mon cœur avait aussi une autre grande passion : les enfants et l'enseignement. Pendant plus de 20 ans, </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>j'ai vécu des aventures extraordinaires avec mes élèves. Des années de partage qui ont rempli mon cœur. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Et puis un jour, j'ai rencontré mon Amoureux…</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Ensemble, nous avons découvert une vieille bâtisse. Fatiguée, abîmée, mais tellement </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>pleine d'histoire et de charme !</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Là où certains voyaient des murs à refaire, moi, je voyais déjà mille possibilités.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="fr-CH" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:rPr><a:t>Nous ne le savions pas encore, mais cette maison allait changer bien plus que notre quotidien…</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="fr-CH" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/><a:cs typeface="Didot" panose="02000503000000020003" pitchFamily="2" charset="-79"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="fr-FR" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree><p:extLst><p:ext uri="{BB962C8B-B14F-4D97-AF65-F5344CB8AC3E}"><p14:creationId xmlns:p14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/powerpoint/2010/main" val="2921191302"/></p:ext></p:extLst></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>